  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n2/3 of 3000\n\n2/5 of 1500\n\n**Formula Used:**\n\nDifference = (2)/(3) of 3000 - (2)/(5) of 1500\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(2)/(3) of 3000 = 2 × (3000 / 3)\n\n⇒ 2 × 1000 = 2000\n\n(2)/(5) of 1500 = 2 × (1500 / 5)\n\n⇒ 2 × 300 = 600\n\nDifference = 2000 - 600\n\n⇒ 1400\n\n**The correct answer is option 4, 1400.**",
